'''6†.''' Duality. [Rare.]
{{smaller block|Th’ Vnitie dwels in God, ith’ Fiend the ''Twine''.{{right|''Sylvester'', tr. of Du Bartas’s Weeks, ii., The Magnificence.}}}}

{{smaller|'''Paper twine''', wrapping-twine made of long, continuous strips of paper, stretched, twisted, and sometimes sized or varnished.}}

